# November 22, 2026: northern Westchester County, New York (the city of Peekskill, the Town of Cortlandt with
# Van Cortlandtville and Croton-on-Hudson, the Town of Yorktown and the village of Ossining), with the West Point Foundry
# across the Putnam County line at Cold Spring. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region midh; it offered
# Peekskill, Tarrytown and Katonah, and the Atlas had nothing east of the Hudson within 15 km of Peekskill).
# Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text, Scenic Hudson's preserve brochure, Historic Hudson Valley,
# Westchester County Parks, the Town of Yorktown, the Town of Cortlandt, the New York-New Jersey Trail Conference,
# New York State Parks, the Friends of the Old Croton Aqueduct, the Croton historian's blog (crotonhistory.org),
# St. Peter's Episcopal Church, the Van Cortlandtville Historical Society, Amawalk Friends Meeting and the Lincoln
# Depot Museum.
